  "solution": "**Formula used**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculation**\n\n0.01 + 0.68 × 0.68 + 0.22 × 0.22 + 0.044 + 0.136 + 0.44 × 0.68\n\nlet, a = 0.68 and b = 0.22\n\n0.01 + 0.682 + 0.222 + 2 × 0.22 × 0.68 + 0.044 + 0.136\n\n⇒ 0.01 + (0.90)² + 0.044 + 0.136\n\n⇒ 0.01 + 0.81 + 0.044 + 0.136\n\n⇒ 0.864 + 0.136\n\n**The answer is 1.**",
